            "properties": {
                "0": {
                    "name": "block",
                    "value": "The string_builder node collects text until you ask for it.\n\nEvery message to 'string in' is added on, with a space between pieces when neither side already has one. Anything arriving at 'issue text' - a bang, a click on its button - sends the collected text and starts again.\n\nWhere gather_sentence decides for itself when a sentence is finished, string_builder leaves that to the patch: a button, a pause detector, the end of a recognition turn.\n\nSYNTAX:\nstring_builder\n\nINPUTS and PARAMETERS:\n\nissue text:\nSend what has been collected, and start again. The word 'clear' here empties it without sending.\n\nstring in:\nThe text to add.\n\nOUTPUTS:\n\ntext out:\nThe collected text. Asking with nothing collected sends an empty string.\n\nRELATED:\ngather_sentence collects until a sentence ends.\ncombine joins several inlets into one string at once.",
                    "value_type": "str"
                },
                "1": {
                    "name": "lock",
                    "value": true,
                    "value_type": "bool"
                },
                "2": {
                    "name": "width",
                    "value": 760,
                    "value_type": "int"
                },
                "3": {
                    "name": "height",
                    "value": 560,
                    "value_type": "int"
                },
                "4": {
                    "name": "text_size",
                    "value": "30",
                    "value_type": "str"
                }
            },
            "text": "The string_builder node collects text until you ask for it.\n\nEvery message to 'string in' is added on, with a space between pieces when neither side already has one. Anything arriving at 'issue text' - a bang, a click on its button - sends the collected text and starts again.\n\nWhere gather_sentence decides for itself when a sentence is finished, string_builder leaves that to the patch: a button, a pause detector, the end of a recognition turn.\n\nSYNTAX:\nstring_builder\n\nINPUTS and PARAMETERS:\n\nissue text:\nSend what has been collected, and start again. The word 'clear' here empties it without sending.\n\nstring in:\nThe text to add.\n\nOUTPUTS:\n\ntext out:\nThe collected text. Asking with nothing collected sends an empty string.\n\nRELATED:\ngather_sentence collects until a sentence ends.\ncombine joins several inlets into one string at once."
        },
